## 🛡️ **Security Requirements (MANDATORY)**

### 1. **Input Validation & Sanitization**

```php
// ALWAYS use WordPress sanitization functions
$title = sanitize_text_field($_POST['title']);
$description = sanitize_textarea_field($_POST['description']);
$url = esc_url_raw($_POST['canonical_url']);
$post_id = intval($_POST['post_id']);

// ALWAYS validate input
if (!$post_id || $post_id <= 0) {
    return new WP_Error('invalid_post_id', 'Invalid post ID');
}
```

### 2. **Output Escaping (MANDATORY)**

```php
// ALWAYS escape output
echo esc_html($user_data);
echo '<input value="' . esc_attr($value) . '">';
echo '<a href="' . esc_url($url) . '">Link</a>';
echo '<script>var data = "' . esc_js($data) . '";</script>';
```

### 3. **Permission Checks (MANDATORY)**

```php
// ALWAYS check capabilities
if (!current_user_can('edit_posts')) {
    return new WP_Error('insufficient_permissions', 'User cannot edit posts');
}

// REST API permission callbacks
'permission_callback' => function() {
    return current_user_can('edit_posts');
}
```

### 4. **Nonce Verification (MANDATORY for forms/AJAX)**

```php
// Create nonces
wp_nonce_field('rank_math_api_action', 'rank_math_api_nonce');

// Verify nonces
if (!wp_verify_nonce($_POST['rank_math_api_nonce'], 'rank_math_api_action')) {
    wp_die('Security check failed');
}
```

## 🔧 **WordPress API Usage Standards**

### 1. **REST API Registration**

```php
register_rest_route('rank-math-api/v1', '/update-meta', array(
    'methods'             => 'POST',
    'callback'            => array($this, 'update_meta_callback'),
    'permission_callback' => array($this, 'check_permissions'),
    'args'                => array(
        'post_id' => array(
            'required'          => true,
            'validate_callback' => array($this, 'validate_post_id'),
            'sanitize_callback' => 'intval',
        ),
    ),
));
```

### 2. **Asset Enqueuing (MANDATORY)**

```php
// ALWAYS use WordPress functions
wp_enqueue_script(
    'rank-math-api-admin',
    RANK_MATH_API_PLUGIN_URL . 'assets/js/admin.js',
    array('jquery'),
    RANK_MATH_API_VERSION,
    true
);

wp_localize_script('rank-math-api-admin', 'rankMathApi', array(
    'ajaxUrl' => admin_url('admin-ajax.php'),
    'nonce'   => wp_create_nonce('rank_math_api_nonce'),
));
```

## 🔄 **Auto-Update System Rules**

### 1. **GitHub Integration Requirements**

```php
// ALWAYS implement proper GitHub API handling
private function get_latest_github_release() {
    // Rate limiting (5-minute intervals)
    $last_check = get_option('rank_math_api_last_github_check', 0);
    $check_interval = 300;

    if (time() - $last_check < $check_interval) {
        return new WP_Error('rate_limited', 'Rate limited: too many requests');
    }

    // Authentication headers for higher rate limits
    $headers = array(
        'Accept'     => 'application/vnd.github.v3+json',
        'User-Agent' => 'WordPress/' . get_bloginfo('version') . '; ' . get_bloginfo('url')
    );

    if ($this->github_token) {
        $headers['Authorization'] = 'token ' . $this->github_token;
    }

    // Implementation...
}
```

### 2. **Caching Requirements**

```php
// ALWAYS implement caching for GitHub API responses
set_transient('rank_math_api_github_release', $release_data, HOUR_IN_SECONDS);
```

